 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg2-00",
   "text": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "spoken": "先给一句准确的说法。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 2.376,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 3.126
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-01",
   "text": "追回的窗口，以小时计。",
   "spoken": "追回的窗口，以小时计。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-01.mp3",
   "start": 4.196,
   "dur": 2.952,
   "speechStart": 4.294,
   "speechEnd": 6.329
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-02",
   "text": "头几个小时里，被盗的钱，还是可冻结的稳定币，是交易所里的充值，或者是链上可以暂停的合约份额。",
   "spoken": "头几个小时里，被盗的钱，还是可冻结的稳定币，是交易所里的充值，或者是链上可以暂停的合约份额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-02.mp3",
   "start": 7.368,
   "dur": 8.688,
   "speechStart": 7.466,
   "speechEnd": 15.227
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-03",
   "text": "几个小时之后，它会变成跨链后的原生币，混币器里的存款，或者场外交易的现金。",
   "spoken": "几个小时之后，它会变成跨链后的原生币，混币器里的存款，或者场外交易的现金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.276,
   "dur": 6.864,
   "speechStart": 16.374,
   "speechEnd": 22.302
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-04",
   "text": "这里有两个动作。",
   "spoken": "这里有两个动作。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-04.mp3",
   "start": 23.36,
   "dur": 1.92,
   "speechStart": 23.458,
   "speechEnd": 24.446
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-05",
   "text": "资金追踪，是沿着链上交易，跟踪钱的去向。",
   "spoken": "资金追踪，是沿着链上交易，跟踪钱的去向。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-05.mp3",
   "start": 25.5,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 25.598,
   "speechEnd": 29.145
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-06",
   "text": "冻结，是由发行方、交易所或链上机制，阻止某个地址转出资产。",
   "spoken": "冻结，是由发行方、交易所或链上机制，阻止某个地址转出资产。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.208,
   "dur": 6.96,
   "speechStart": 30.306,
   "speechEnd": 36.318
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-07",
   "text": "打个比方，抢劫发生后，警方在城市的每个出口设卡。",
   "spoken": "打个比方，抢劫发生后，警方在城市的每个出口设卡。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-07.mp3",
   "start": 37.388,
   "dur": 4.968,
   "speechStart": 37.486,
   "speechEnd": 41.521
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-08",
   "text": "出口就是稳定币发行方、交易所、跨链桥和混币器。",
   "spoken": "出口就是稳定币发行方、交易所、跨链桥和混币器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-08.mp3",
   "start": 42.576,
   "dur": 5.736,
   "speechStart": 42.674,
   "speechEnd": 47.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-09",
   "text": "设卡越早，拦住的车越多。",
   "spoken": "设卡越早，拦住的车越多。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-09.mp3",
   "start": 48.532,
   "dur": 3.096,
   "speechStart": 48.63,
   "speechEnd": 50.796
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-10",
   "text": "劫匪一旦开上国道，换了车牌，再拦就很难了。",
   "spoken": "劫匪一旦开上国道，换了车牌，再拦就很难了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-10.mp3",
   "start": 51.848,
   "dur": 4.728,
   "speechStart": 51.946,
   "speechEnd": 55.755
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-11",
   "text": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "spoken": "这个比方有一处不成立。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-11.mp3",
   "start": 56.796,
   "dur": 2.712,
   "speechStart": 56.894,
   "speechEnd": 58.679
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-12",
   "text": "链上的出口，大多不归任何警察管。",
   "spoken": "链上的出口，大多不归任何警察管。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-12.mp3",
   "start": 59.728,
   "dur": 3.648,
   "speechStart": 59.826,
   "speechEnd": 62.552
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-13",
   "text": "去中心化的跨链桥、混币器和交易所，没有义务配合。",
   "spoken": "去中心化的跨链桥、混币器和交易所，没有义务配合。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-13.mp3",
   "start": 63.596,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 63.694,
   "speechEnd": 68.134
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-14",
   "text": "能拦住的，主要是有中心化运营方的那部分出口。",
   "spoken": "能拦住的，主要是有中心化运营方的那部分出口。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-14.mp3",
   "start": 69.192,
   "dur": 4.44,
   "speechStart": 69.29,
   "speechEnd": 72.778
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-15",
   "text": "攻击者也清楚这一点，所以路线很固定。",
   "spoken": "攻击者也清楚这一点，所以路线很固定。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-15.mp3",
   "start": 73.852,
   "dur": 4.128,
   "speechStart": 73.95,
   "speechEnd": 77.152
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-16",
   "text": "第一步，把稳定币换掉，躲开发行方冻结。",
   "spoken": "第一步，把稳定币换掉，躲开发行方冻结。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-16.mp3",
   "start": 78.2,
   "dur": 4.272,
   "speechStart": 78.298,
   "speechEnd": 81.631
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-17",
   "text": "第二步，分散到大量地址，抬高追踪成本。",
   "spoken": "第二步，分散到大量地址，抬高追踪成本。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-17.mp3",
   "start": 82.692,
   "dur": 4.584,
   "speechStart": 82.79,
   "speechEnd": 86.444
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-18",
   "text": "第三步，跨链，或者进混币器，切断链上的关联。",
   "spoken": "第三步，跨链，或者进混币器，切断链上的关联。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-18.mp3",
   "start": 87.496,
   "dur": 5.352,
   "speechStart": 87.594,
   "speechEnd": 91.998
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-19",
   "text": "最后，通过场外交易，或者小额分批进交易所，换成现金。",
   "spoken": "最后，通过场外交易，或者小额分批进交易所，换成现金。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-19.mp3",
   "start": 93.068,
   "dur": 5.952,
   "speechStart": 93.166,
   "speechEnd": 98.178
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-20",
   "text": "实在走不掉，他就等，等关注度下降。",
   "spoken": "实在走不掉，他就等，等关注度下降。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/media/video/skeuo/ep25/audio/lines/seg2-20.mp3",
   "start": 99.24,
   "dur": 4.08,
   "speechStart": 99.338,
   "speechEnd": 102.48
  },
  {
   "id": "seg2-21",
